{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339421-artifact-tasnim-the-fivefold-cauldron-of-destruction","id":1339421,"title":"[Artifact] Tasnim, The Fivefold Cauldron of Destruction","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-04T12:05:29-07:00","id":1339421,"title":"[Artifact] Tasnim, The Fivefold Cauldron of Destruction","content":"One of my players plans to build a Dragon Sigh Wand in our game's future, so I whipped up an Evocation tree for him and thought I might share:<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uFqYPN9IbmjpYmZXKbDvAZUuPk3uxhsJdSs9EE-6utI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Tasnim, The Fivefold Cauldron of Destruction</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-04T13:00:09-07:00","id":1339428,"title":"","content":"Nice artifact, simple and to the point. I like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-04T15:35:54-07:00","id":1339453,"title":"","content":"Smashing attacks, from long range, hitting multiple targets?<br /> <br /> I would abuse that so hard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-04T19:10:42-07:00","id":1339496,"title":"","content":"Well, that does take at least two rounds to load, a round to aim, and a quite a few motes. Might be overstrong anyway, but I haven't playtested it with my group yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-05T14:20:16-07:00","id":1339700,"title":"","content":"I'm not really an expert on 3e Charm balance, but this is a damned cool artifact. I want this gun.<br /> <br /> Just to be clear: when the wielder uses Enduring Arcane Elixir to increase the duration of some combination by (Intelligence) rounds, does that basically mean she can fire the thing (Intelligence) extra times before needing to reload again? (I wouldn't say it's necessarily a problem, since you'd have to spend 2-3 actions loading it as well as 10-12 motes to set up those charges, but still.) Or is it meant to increase the duration of some of the special mixed-element effects (e.g. the Defense penalty from the Ice blast) instead?<br /> <br /> Also, regarding Explosive Blast Deflagration: should there perhaps be some kind of limit on how much Initiative the wielder can personally gain from secondary targets in the blast radius? I'm pretty sure that area-effect withering attacks usually have something like that. (On the other hand, this particular blast <i>is</i> close-range only, and if your enemies stick close together after seeing you load the big gun with explosion juice, maybe they deserve it.) Possibly this Charm should have some kind of alternate mechanic for what happens if you shoot a battle group with it, too?<br /> <br /> Also also, does Distant Projection Catalyst stack with the Metal effect from Sympathetic Chemistry Admixture? I was a little surprised to see two different range-boosting effects, although when the base range is only Short I guess it seems reasonable enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-05T18:42:51-07:00","id":1339739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339421-artifact-tasnim-the-fivefold-cauldron-of-destruction?p=1339700#post1339700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not really an expert on 3e Charm balance, but this is a damned cool artifact. I want this gun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for the praise.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Just to be clear: when the wielder uses Enduring Arcane Elixir to increase the duration of some combination by (Intelligence) rounds, does that basically mean she can fire the thing (Intelligence) extra times before needing to reload again? (I wouldn't say it's necessarily a problem, since you'd have to spend 2-3 actions loading it as well as 10-12 motes to set up those charges, but still.) Or is it meant to increase the duration of some of the special mixed-element effects (e.g. the Defense penalty from the Ice blast) instead? </div> </div> </div>The second option is what was meant. This gun is meant for a &quot;spend multiple rounds reloading, fire support effect, repeat&quot; sort of combat style.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, regarding Explosive Blast Deflagration: should there perhaps be some kind of limit on how much Initiative the wielder can personally gain from secondary targets in the blast radius? I'm pretty sure that area-effect withering attacks usually have something like that. (On the other hand, this particular blast <i>is</i> close-range only, and if your enemies stick close together after seeing you load the big gun with explosion juice, maybe they deserve it.) Possibly this Charm should have some kind of alternate mechanic for what happens if you shoot a battle group with it, too? </div> </div> </div>Those are some good concerns. I'll do some thinking and then update the Charm a little.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also also, does Distant Projection Catalyst stack with the Metal effect from Sympathetic Chemistry Admixture? I was a little surprised to see two different range-boosting effects, although when the base range is only Short I guess it seems reasonable enough. </div> </div> </div>My player wanted to do the &quot;I invented a gun that shoots real bullets&quot; thing. When I told him that firepowder didn't explode until absurd amounts, he switched to ideas about alternate elemental loads for mundane firewands. The metal effect was a product of the whole thing. That's a really long way to say that the two range boosting effects do stack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}